    var patternAxes=[['EI','JP'],['SN','TF'],['EI','TF'],['SN','JP']];
    var tentativePatterns=[
      ['Context-sensitive working rhythm','Your preferred balance between interaction, private focus, planning, and adaptability is not settled. Compare the same task in solo, collaborative, structured, and flexible conditions.'],
      ['Context-sensitive problem approach','Your balance between concrete evidence, possibilities, analytical criteria, and people impact is not settled. Record which approach improves the quality of different decisions.'],
