      '<div class="result-section"><h4>Letter-by-letter response support</h4><p>This score combines separation between the two sides with agreement across the first and second halves. It describes these answers only; it is not clinical confidence or population-based reliability.</p><div class="insight-grid">'+support+'</div></div>'+
      '<div class="result-section"><h4>How you answered</h4><div class="insight-grid"><article><h5>Overall response pattern</h5><p>'+r.responsePattern.summary+'</p></article><article><h5>Most balanced pair</h5><p>'+r.responsePattern.mostNeutral+'</p></article><article><h5>Most decisive pair</h5><p>'+r.responsePattern.mostDecisive+'</p></article><article><h5>Longest reflection</h5><p>'+r.responsePattern.slowest+' Timing can reflect thoughtfulness, interruption, uncertainty, or reading pace; it is not ability.</p></article></div></div>'+
