    '<div class="result-section"><h4>Likely contribution pattern</h4><div class="insight-grid"><article><h5>Strengths to test in real work</h5>'+listHtml(r.displayProfile.strengths)+'</article><article><h5>Watchouts to monitor</h5>'+listHtml(r.displayProfile.watchouts)+'</article></div></div>'+
    '<div class="result-section"><h4>Work-environment implications</h4><p>Use these as interview and experiment questions, not demands that every role must satisfy.</p><div class="insight-grid">'+workHtml+'</div></div>'+
